{
  "id": "cor_2020",
  "name": "COR 2020 (Certificate of Recognition)",
  "version": "2020",
  "description": "The Certificate of Recognition national standard as administered in Ontario by the Infrastructure Health & Safety Association (IHSA) on behalf of the Canadian Federation of Construction Safety Associations. COR is an audited health and safety management system: certification requires an external audit in the certifying year and internal audits in maintenance years, and is a common prequalification condition for ICI and public-sector work. Element titles below follow the COR 2020 audit instrument; confirm element numbering and current scoring weights against the IHSA audit protocol in force before presenting a conformance claim, since IHSA revises the instrument periodically.",
